<!--Post: 10032--><!--Time: 1109730867-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST10032"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Yomama<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Yomama<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Tuesday, March 01, 2005 - 6:34 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->nobody knows what another person is doing or thinking 24-7 as a woman who&#39;s husband was acused of breaking and entering and attempted rape years ago, it never entered my mind that he was out there trying to rape someone...!!!out getting drunk yes ...trying to rape someone no. that thought had never entered my mind....although i,ve had a bit of experience with this, it&#39;s nothing compared to what paula  is going thru and has gone thru...even if she thought that some things were maybe a little wierd or off the wall,  why would she suspect her own husband of being a serial killer?   and he&#39;s such a good liar and deceiever.  i&#39;m sure that he always had an explaination for everything. even the blood...there was an injured animal. if he could fool the police force and fbi for all these years then i&#39;m sure he had his family fooled too. after all this was a man that was a city worker, active in his church and a boyscout leader  etc, etc...now i do admit that i&#39;m pretty nosy and would be checkin out whats in the shed and garage or where ever but now that i think about it i haven&#39;t checked out all the stuff the guy i&#39;m with now has out in our shed due to lack of interest on my part ...i&#39;ll bet ya there&#39;s more then one woman thats going to start doing that now...!!!i have to say that most women don&#39;t suspect their husband of being a serial killer...!!! maybe in hind site she may now look back and piece things together but it&#39;s hard to do at the time...i sure would like to hear her side of this<!--/Text--></td></tr>
